Spec: Verified Android signing subject policy

Purpose:
  Preserve a caller identity across OS-verified signing rotation while separating reinstall and unrelated signers.

Owns:
  ./SubjectIdentity.java

Must:
  Accept only platform-verified signer snapshots, with original-to-current lineage ordering.
  Bind scope to UID, package, first install and original signer or exact multiple-signer set.
  Keep full current provenance for snapshot comparison and owner review without trusting application declarations.
